{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/652770-1e-first-chapter-advice","id":652770,"title":"[1E] First chapter advice","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-05T10:46:28-07:00","id":652770,"title":"[1E] First chapter advice","content":"It's been a few years since I've run nWod or played V:tR. My current group of fantasy hack-and-slashers wants to try out Vampire, but their tastes stray from a more socially in-depth game. Not wanting to go full <i>Underworld</i>, maybe something more along the lines of <i>Near Dark</i>, I got the idea for a scenario that I think would interest them.<div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Many years ago a melodramatic vampire left the big city and went to live in a dilapidated country manor in the woods off the interstate near a prestigious university. He turned a college student so as to not be alone. He kept the young vampire around by (halfway) lying that they are only safe there because of him, and that the city was too dangerous. They would go hunting together along the interstate and lured students back to the manor with the promise of partying. These episodes rarely ended in fatalities. As time went on, the sire fell into paranoia and his usual capriciousness became cruelty, he eventually staked his childe and placed them inside a mausoleum in the estate's cemetery. This process repeated itself a few more times until the present day when the current childe began noticing his sire becoming more withdrawn and harsh. While the sire was out one night, the childe stumbled onto the mausoleum and found his brothers/sisters there in torpor. He decided to remove the stakes. </span></div>The offspring are the players, and what they do next is where the story begins. I have a decent amount of information about the manor house, the woods, the small town nearby, and the university. The players can go in any direction. I guess I just want to hear any thoughts about the scenario, how you think it would play out, and maybe any rules that could come up that I could have overlooked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7644,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7644-associategreen","user":"AssociateGreen","date":". 09-05-2015, 11:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7644-associategreen","name":"AssociateGreen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T18:02:13-07:00","id":653270,"title":"","content":"As the players are the former childer of the vampire maybe you can do some flashbacks to the pre-staking period of each of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-07T07:30:51-07:00","id":655094,"title":"","content":"Or you could start with establishing how old each of the characters are, via the latest childer telling them the current date.<br /> <br /> By the way, how picky is the sire with choosing a childer?<br /> <br /> A chronicle where they're all members of the same clan (and especially under the same sire) risks everybody being along the same archetype.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}